urname>Cubin</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rhie</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bullock</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tahiri-Alaoui</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>James</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Structural determinants of conformationally selective, prion-binding aptamers</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>2004</year><volume>279</volume><fpage>13102</fpage><lpage>13109</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14711834</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.M310928200</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zou</surname><given-names>WQ</given-names></name><name><surname>Zheng</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gray</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Gambetti</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antibody to DNA detects scrapie but not normal prion protein</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>2004</year><volume>101</volume><fpage>1380</fpage><lpage>1385</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14734804</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.0307825100</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Korth</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Stierli</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Streit</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Moser</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaller</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Fischer</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Schulz-Schaeffer</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surna